---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="EPA 608 Exam Prep Privacy Policy - Logicpath Systems">
    <section class="legal-page" style="padding-top: 120px; min-height: 100vh;">
        <div class="container reveal">
            <div class="glass-card" style="padding: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 4rem);">
                <header style="margin-bottom: 3rem; text-align: center;">
                    <h1 class="gradient-text">Privacy Policy</h1>
                    <p style="color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;"><strong>EPA 608 Exam Prep</strong></p>
                    <p style="color: var(--text-secondary);"><strong>Effective Date:</strong> November 1, 2026 &middot; <strong>Last Updated:</strong> November 1, 2026</p>
                    <p style="color: var(--text-secondary);"><strong>Publisher:</strong> Logicpath Systems</p>
                </header>

                <main class="legal-content">
                    <p>Logicpath Systems (&ldquo;we&rdquo;, &ldquo;our&rdquo;, or &ldquo;us&rdquo;) operates the EPA 608 Exam Prep mobile application (the &ldquo;App&rdquo;). This Privacy Policy describes how information is collected, used, and shared when you use the App.</p>

                    <hr style="margin: 2.5rem 0; border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);" />

                    <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>

                    <h3>1.1 Information You Provide</h3>
                    <p>The App does not require an account. We do not collect your name, email address, phone number, or any other personally identifiable information through the App.</p>

                    <h3>1.2 Automatically Collected Information</h3>
                    <ul>
                        <li><strong>Device information:</strong> device model, operating system version, unique device identifiers, and mobile network information.</li>
                        <li><strong>Usage data:</strong> app interactions, features used, session duration, crash logs, and performance data.</li>
                        <li><strong>Advertising data:</strong> the Google Advertising ID provided by your device, which you can reset or opt out of in device settings.</li>
                    </ul>

                    <h3>1.3 Information Collected by Third Parties</h3>
                    <ul>
                        <li><strong>Google AdMob</strong> serves advertisements in the App and may collect device identifiers, IP address, and usage data to serve personalized or non-personalized ads. See <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color: var(--accent-secondary);">Google's Privacy Policy</a>.</li>
                        <li><strong>Google Analytics for Firebase</strong> may collect app usage analytics to help us improve the App.</li>
                    </ul>

                    <hr style="margin: 2.5rem 0; border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);" />

                    <h2>2. How We Use Information</h2>
                    <p>We use collected information to:</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Operate and maintain the App</li>
                        <li>Improve performance and fix bugs</li>
                        <li>Display advertisements through Google AdMob</li>
                        <li>Analyze usage patterns to improve user experience</li>
                        <li>Comply with legal obligations</li>
                    </ul>
                    <p>We do not use collected information to identify you personally, sell your data to third parties, or send you marketing email.</p>

                    <hr style="margin: 2.5rem 0; border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);" />

                    <h2>3. Data Storage</h2>
                    <p>All study progress, quiz scores, spaced-repetition data, streak information, and settings are stored locally on your device in the App's private storage, which the operating system isolates from other apps. This data never leaves your device and is not transmitted to any server.</p>
                    <p>The App does not require or support user accounts, and there is no cloud sync. If you uninstall the App, all local study data is permanently deleted.</p>

                    <hr style="margin: 2.5rem 0; border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);" />

                    <h2>4. Advertising</h2>
                    <p>The App displays advertisements served by Google AdMob. You may see personalized ads based on interests determined by Google, or non-personalized ads based on contextual information.</p>
                    <p>You can opt out of personalized advertising by:</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Adjusting your device ad settings (on Android: Settings &rarr; Google &rarr; Ads)</li>
                        <li>Resetting your Advertising ID in device settings</li>
                    </ul>
                    <p>For more information on how Google uses data for advertising, see <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color: var(--accent-secondary);">Google's Advertising Technologies</a>.</p>
                    <p>If you are in the EEA or UK, the App presents a consent form before ads are requested. You can review or withdraw that choice at any time using Ad Privacy Options in the App's Settings.</p>

                    <hr style="margin: 2.5rem 0; border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);" />

                    <h2>5. Children's Privacy</h2>
                    <p>The App is not directed at children under the age of 13, and we do not knowingly collect personal information from them. If we become aware that a child under 13 has provided personal information, we will take steps to delete it. If you believe a child under 13 may have provided information through the App, please contact us.</p>

                    <hr style="margin: 2.5rem 0; border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);" />

                    <h2>6. Data Sharing</h2>
                    <p>We do not sell, trade, or rent personal information. We may share automatically collected, non-personally identifiable information with:</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li><strong>Google AdMob,</strong> for advertising purposes</li>
                        <li><strong>Google Firebase,</strong> for analytics purposes</li>
                        <li><strong>Law enforcement,</strong> where required by law</li>
                    </ul>

                    <hr style="margin: 2.5rem 0; border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);" />

                    <h2>7. Data Retention</h2>
                    <p>Local data (study progress, scores, settings) stays on your device until you clear the App's data or uninstall the App. Automatically collected data (crash logs, usage analytics) is retained according to Google's standard retention policies.</p>

                    <hr style="margin: 2.5rem 0; border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);" />

                    <h2>8. Security</h2>
                    <p>We take reasonable measures to protect information collected through the App. Study data is kept in the App's private storage on your device, isolated from other apps by the operating system, and is never transmitted to our servers. The App does not collect or store names, email addresses, passwords, or payment details.</p>
                    <p>However, no method of electronic storage is 100% secure, and we cannot guarantee absolute security.</p>

                    <hr style="margin: 2.5rem 0; border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);" />

                    <h2>9. Your Rights</h2>
                    <p>Depending on your jurisdiction, you may have the right to access, correct, or delete your data, opt out of personalized advertising, and request information about data collected.</p>
                    <p>Because all study data is stored locally on your device, you have full control over it: clear the App's data in your device settings, or uninstall the App.</p>

                    <h3>California Residents (CCPA)</h3>
                    <p>If you are a California resident, you have the right to know what personal information is collected, request deletion of your personal information, opt out of the sale of personal information, and not be discriminated against for exercising these rights. We do not sell personal information.</p>

                    <h3>European Union Residents (GDPR)</h3>
                    <p>If you are located in the European Union, you have rights under the General Data Protection Regulation, including the rights of access, rectification, erasure, restriction of processing, and data portability. Our legal basis for processing is legitimate interest (improving the App) and consent (for personalized advertising).</p>

                    <hr style="margin: 2.5rem 0; border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);" />

                    <h2>10. Changes to This Policy</h2>
                    <p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Changes will be posted within the App and on our website. Your continued use of the App after changes constitutes acceptance of the updated Privacy Policy.</p>

                    <hr style="margin: 2.5rem 0; border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);" />

                    <h2>11. Contact Us</h2>
                    <p>If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact us:</p>
                    <p><strong>Logicpath Systems</strong><br/>
                    📧 Email: <a href="mailto:contact@logicpathsystems.com" style="color: var(--accent-secondary);"><strong>contact@logicpathsystems.com</strong></a><br/>
                    Website: <a href="https://logicpathsystems.com" style="color: var(--accent-secondary);">https://logicpathsystems.com</a></p>

                    <hr style="margin: 4rem 0; border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);" />

                    <h2 style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 2rem;">Disclaimer</h2>

                    <h3>Not Affiliated With the EPA</h3>
                    <p>EPA 608 Exam Prep is an independent study tool developed and published by Logicpath Systems. This app is NOT affiliated with, endorsed by, sponsored by, or officially connected to the U.S. Environmental Protection Agency (EPA), any EPA-approved testing organization, or any government body.</p>

                    <h3>Educational Purpose Only</h3>
                    <p>All content in this app &mdash; including questions, explanations, flashcards, PT chart data, and statutory calculators &mdash; is provided for educational and exam preparation purposes only. This app does not constitute legal, regulatory, or professional advice.</p>

                    <h3>No Guarantee of Exam Results</h3>
                    <p>While we strive to provide accurate, current, and comprehensive study material, using this app does not guarantee passage of the EPA Section 608 certification exam. Actual exam questions are drawn from the EPA's test bank and may differ from the practice questions in this app. Your result depends on your individual preparation and the specific test administered.</p>

                    <h3>Accuracy of Content</h3>
                    <p>Questions and study material are derived from publicly available EPA publications. Regulations are subject to change. While we make reasonable efforts to keep content current, this app may not reflect the most recent regulatory updates.</p>
                    <p>Always verify current regulations at <a href="https://www.epa.gov/section608" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color: var(--accent-secondary);">https://www.epa.gov/section608</a>.</p>

                    <h3>Limitation of Liability</h3>
                    <p>Logicpath Systems, its developers, and contributors shall not be liable for any direct, indirect, incidental, special, or consequential damages arising from the use of this app, including but not limited to exam failure, job loss, regulatory penalties, or reliance on potentially outdated information.</p>

                    <h3>Use at Your Own Risk</h3>
                    <p>By using this app, you acknowledge that you have read and understood this disclaimer and agree to use the app at your own risk.</p>

                    <p style="text-align: center; margin-top: 2rem; color: var(--text-tertiary);">&copy; 2026 Logicpath Systems. All rights reserved.</p>
                </main>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
</Layout>

<style>
    .legal-content h2 {
        color: var(--text-primary);
        margin-top: 2.5rem;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
        font-size: 1.5rem;
    }

    .legal-content h3 {
        color: var(--text-primary);
        margin-top: 1.5rem;
        margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
        font-size: 1.25rem;
    }

    .legal-content p, .legal-content ul {
        color: var(--text-secondary);
        margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
        font-size: 1.05rem;
        line-height: 1.7;
    }

    .legal-content ul {
        padding-left: 2rem;
        margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }

    .legal-content li {
        margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }
</style>
